# A LIBRARY THAT DECLARES CEILINGS AND HOLDS NOTHING.
# Everything a well-formed library carries is here except the entries. It exists so the
# checker can be shown refusing NOTHING — a gate given nothing must not pass, and an
# instrument nobody has watched refuse has measured nothing.
LIBRARY                          COMPOUNDS
DECLARED_ENTRIES_PER_IDENTITY    1
DECLARED_ENTRIES_PER_PROGRAM     1
DECLARED_ENTRIES_PER_SEAL        1
DECLARED_ENTRIES_PER_MEASURED    1
DECLARED_ENTRIES_PER_TRIPLE      1
# A control case is not published, so it names a page that does not exist and clause L9
# reports NOT_KNOWN rather than REFUSED. A control case must be refused for the ONE reason
# it was built to demonstrate, or it demonstrates nothing.
PUBLISHED_PAGE                   This-Control-Case-Is-Not-Published.md
